<!--
  Loaded only when the bundled JCEF plugin (com.intellij.modules.jcef) is
  present. It contributes no extensions: its whole job is to put that plugin on
  this plugin's classloader parents, so com.intellij.ui.jcef.JBCefApp resolves.

  From build 262 JCEF ships as a separate bundled plugin rather than as part of
  com.intellij.modules.platform. Without this, SynthesisPopup's JBCefApp
  reference threw NoClassDefFoundError on the EDT the moment a panel row was
  clicked. Optional, because SynthesisPopup falls back to a JEditorPane when
  the browser is unavailable — a user who disabled JCEF must still get the
  plugin, just without the rich synthesis view.
-->
<idea-plugin/>
